msgstr "<br />如需通過羣組/頻道推送，請創建一個非中文的羣組或頻道（便於查找 chatid，後續再更名）<br />將機器人添加至羣組，發送信息後通過 https://api.telegram.org/bot token /getUpdates 獲取 chatid"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/config.js:226
msgid "Please refer to the comments and other interface files for modifications. Limited resources, no longer supporting more interfaces, please debug on your own.<br />You can use a similar website to check the JSON file format: https://www.google.com/search?q=JSON+Parser+Online<br />Please use the 「Save」 button in the text box."
msgstr "請參照註釋和其他接口文件修改，精力有限，不再支持更多接口，自行調試<br />請參考類似網站檢查 JSON 文件格式：https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=json在線解析<br />文本框請使用「保存」按鈕"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/config.js:229
