#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:33
msgid "Offline detection count"
msgstr "離線檢測次數"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:37
msgid "If the device has good signal strength and no Wi-Fi sleep issues, you can reduce the above values.<br/>Due to the mysterious nature of Wi-Fi sleep during the night, if you encounter frequent disconnections, please adjust the parameters accordingly.<br/>..╮(╯_╰）╭.."
msgstr "若設備信號強度良好，無息屏 WiFi 休眠問題，可以減少以上數值<br/>因夜間 WiFi 息屏休眠較爲玄學，遇到設備頻繁推送斷開，煩請自行調整參數<br/>..╮(╯_╰）╭.."

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:42
msgid "Offline timeout applies only to the devices that receive push notifications"
msgstr "離線超時只針對推送設備"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:95
msgid "IP address to always scan"
msgstr "始終掃描的 IP"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:95
msgid "The IPs in the list are always subjected to online detection regardless of whether they exist in the ARP list, suitable for secondary routing scenarios."
msgstr "列表中的 IP 始終進行在線檢測，無論它是否存在於 ARP 列表，適用於二級路由等情況"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:45
msgid "When this option is selected, the offline timeout and offline detection count apply only to the devices that require push notifications. Other devices will use default values, which can significantly reduce the time required for detection. However, it may result in inaccurate online time displayed in the online devices list. It is recommended to enable this option only when there are many devices and frequent offline occurrences are observed for specific devices of interest."
msgstr "選中此項後，離線超時時間和離線檢測次數只針對需要推送的設備，其餘設備使用默認值，可有效減少檢測所需的時間，但會造成在線設備列表中的在線時間不準確，僅建議設備較多且關注的設備離線頻繁時使用"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:47
msgid "Disable active detection"
msgstr "關閉主動探測"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:50
msgid "Disable active detection of client online status. Enabling this feature will no longer prompt device online/offline events.<br/>Suitable for users who are not sensitive to online devices but need other features."
msgstr "關閉客戶端在線狀態的主動探測，因誤報較爲嚴重，啓用此功能後設備上下線將不再提示<br/>適用於對在線設備不敏感，但需要其他功能的用戶"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:52
msgid "Maximum concurrent processes"
msgstr "最大併發進程數"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:56
msgid "Do not change the setting value for low-performance devices, or reduce the parameters as appropriate."
msgstr "低性能設備請勿更改設置值，或酌情減少參數"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:120
msgid "Client list sorting method"
msgstr "客戶端列表排序方式"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:52
msgid "This will change the sorting method for both the online device list page and the sorting order in the push content."
msgstr "這將會同時改變在線設備列表頁面和推送內容中的排序方式"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:58
msgid "Custom temperature reading command"
msgstr "自定義溫度讀取命令"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:60
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默認"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:61
msgid "Proxmox Virtual Environment"
msgstr "PVE 虛擬機"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:62
msgid "If you need to use special symbols such as quotes, $, !, etc. in custom commands, you need to escape them yourself.<br/>You can use the command eval echo $(uci get wechatpush-pro.wechatpush-pro.soc_code) to view command output and error information.<br/>The execution result should be a pure number (including decimals) for temperature comparison.<br/>Here is an example that does not require escaping:<br/>cat /sys/class/thermal/thermal_zone0/temp|sort -nr|head -n1|cut -c-2"
msgstr "自定義命令如需使用特殊符號，如引號、$、!等，則需要自行轉義<br/>可以使用 eval echo $(uci get wechatpush-pro.wechatpush-pro.soc_code) 命令查看命令輸出及錯誤信息<br/>執行結果需爲純數字（可帶小數），用於溫度對比<br/>一個無需轉義的例子：<br/>cat /sys/class/thermal/thermal_zone0/temp|sort -nr|head -n1|cut -c-2"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:64
msgid "Host machine address"
msgstr "宿主機地址"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:70
msgid "Host machine SSH port"
msgstr "宿主機 SSH 端口"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:73
msgid "The default SSH port is 22. If you have a custom port, please fill in the custom SSH port.<br/>Please make sure you have set up key-based login, otherwise it may cause script errors.<br/>Install the sensors command on PVE by searching on the internet.<br/>Example for key-based login (modify the address and port number accordingly):<br/>opkg update # Update package list<br/>opkg install openssh-client openssh-keygen # Install openssh client<br/>echo -e \"\\n\" | ssh-keygen -t rsa # Generate key file (no passphrase)<br/>pve_host=`uci get wechatpush-pro.config.server_host` || pve_host=\"10.0.0.3\" # Read the PVE host address from the configuration file, If not saved, please fill in by yourself.<br/>pve_port=`uci get wechatpush-pro.config.server_port` || pve_host=\"22\" # Read the PVE host SSH port number from the configuration file, If not saved, please fill in by yourself.<br/>ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=yes root@${pve_host} -p ${pve_port} \"tee -a ~/.ssh/OpenWrt_id_rsa.pub\" < ~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub # Transfer public key to PVE<br/>ssh root@${pve_host} -p ${pve_port} \"cat ~/.ssh/OpenWrt_id_rsa.pub >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys\" # Write public key to PVE<br/>ssh -i /root/.ssh/id_rsa root@${pve_host} -p ${pve_port} sensors # To avoid script errors during the initial connection, please use a private key to connect to PVE and test the temperature command for its proper functioning.<br/>For users who frequently flash firmware, please add /root/.ssh/ to the backup list to avoid duplicate operations."
msgstr "SSH 端口默認爲 22，如有自定義，請填寫自定義 SSH 端口<br/>請確認已經設置好密鑰登陸，否則會引起腳本無法運行等錯誤！<br/>PVE 安裝 sensors 命令自行百度<br/>密鑰登陸例（自行修改地址與端口號）：<br/>opkg update #更新列表<br/>opkg install openssh-client openssh-keygen #安裝openssh客戶端<br/>echo -e \"\\n\" | ssh-keygen -t rsa # 生成密鑰文件（空密碼）<br/>pve_host=`uci get wechatpush-pro.config.server_host` || pve_host=\"10.0.0.3\" # 讀取配置文件中的 pve 主機地址，如果未保存設置，請自行填寫 <br/>pve_port=`uci get wechatpush-pro.config.server_port` || pve_port=\"22\" # 讀取配置文件中的 pve 主機 ssh 端口號，如果未保存設置，請自行填寫 <br/>ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=yes root@${pve_host} -p ${pve_port} \"tee -a ~/.ssh/OpenWrt_id_rsa.pub\" < ~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub # 傳送公鑰到 PVE<br/>ssh root@${pve_host} -p ${pve_port} \"cat ~/.ssh/OpenWrt_id_rsa.pub >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys\" # 寫入公鑰到 PVE<br/>ssh -i /root/.ssh/id_rsa root@${pve_host} -p ${pve_port} sensors # 因首次連接時需要確認，爲避免腳本錯誤，請使用私鑰連接 PVE 並測試溫度命令是否正常運行。<br/>刷機黨自行將 /root/.ssh/ 加入備份列表，避免重複操作"

#: applications/luci-app-wechatpush-pro/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wechatpush-pro/advanced.js:76
